{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Base directory for this skill: /Users/ben/github/toulmin/evals/toulmin/variants/ask-only/skills/toulmin\n\n# Writing the piece\n\nBefore you write, ask the user for what you are missing. Send one message with at most five questions, the most useful first. Ask only what would change the piece and what the request does not already answer. When the answers come back, write the piece as you normally would, and hand it over. When the user does not know something, write without it and do not guess.\n\n\nARGUMENTS: Cover letter for office manager role at a 3-dentist practice (supervises 9). Candidate: 52, 7-year caregiving gap (mother died last spring), previously 11 years office manager at vet clinic (4 vets, 14 staff), scheduling, billing, led 2014 paper-to-software migration, cut 90+ day receivables from ~$38k to ~$9k over last 3 years. During gap managed mother's insurance claims and 6 specialists' appointments. No Dentrix experience (used AVImark). Under 300 words."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1005736b-9e17-4239-b55b-d01131b884cb","uuid":"b2ff2fcb-b627-41d9-bae7-3159c3249ae8","timestamp":"2026-11-16T21:19:28.966Z","isSynthetic":true}
