led. Insurance work is a large part of running a dental office, so those years count as relevant experience.\n- **Dentrix:** The letter is upfront that you haven't used it, then says you're already taking the course and will finish it before your first day. Please make sure that's a promise you're comfortable making.\n- **Supervising staff:** I left this out as you asked. If you did manage people at the clinic, even a few, one sentence about it would strengthen the letter, because the posting asks for someone to supervise 9 people.\n- **Before sending:** Replace [Your Name] and add your contact details at the top.\n\n<final_document>\nDear Dr. Pierce,\n\nI am writing to apply for the Office Manager position at Brookside Family Dental. For eleven years I was office manager at a veterinary clinic with four veterinarians and fourteen staff. I would like to bring that experience to your practice.\n\nAt the clinic I ran scheduling and billing for a busy practice with several doctors. In 2014 I led the clinic's move from paper records to practice management software and kept the office running smoothly throughout the change. In my last three years there, I brought unpaid invoices more than 90 days old down from about $38,000 to $9,000.\n\nFor the past seven years I cared full-time for my mother, who passed away last spring. During that time I handled her insurance claims and coordinated her appointments with six specialists. Doing that work for a patient taught me how much good scheduling and clear billing matter to the people on the other side of the desk, and that is the kind of front office I would want to run for your patients.\n\nYour posting lists Dentrix. At the clinic I used AVImark, and I have enrolled in the Dentrix online training course, which takes about 20 hours. I will have completed it before my first day.\n\nI would welcome the chance to talk with you about how I can support your team and your patients. Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nSincerely,\n\n[Your Name]\n</final_document>","ttft_ms":5952,"type":"result","duration_ms":12964,"uuid":"5dbbed10-cf30-42e8-b832-0db1622f5a22","ttft_stream_ms":1276,"time_to_request_ms":72,"first_content_frame_ms":1276,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":4,"outputTokens":1219,"cacheReadInputTokens":10171,"cacheCreationInputTokens":684,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.0319022,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":501,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":684,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-12-07T10:02:13.271Z"}
